            </div>
            <h3 class="fs-2 text-body-emphasis">Entertainment</h3>
            <p>Bahrain is a hub of entertainment, offering everything from vibrant shopping malls and luxury cinemas to
                thrilling water parks and exciting nightlife. Whether you're looking for adventure or relaxation,
                Bahrain has something for everyone.</p>
            <a href="https://www.viator.com/Bahrain/d4458?m=33953&supag=1236951585182427&supsc=dat-2329109225372500&supai=77309605168910&supdv=c&supnt=nt:o&suplp=143141&supli=204&supti=dat-2329109225372500&tsem=true&supci=dat-2329109225372500&supkw=give%20me%20best%20entertainment%20to%20visit%20in%20bahrain&msclkid=5a400254515f1cf5c66365f33c1de4d0" class="icon-link">
                Explore More
                <img src="..." alt="">
            </a>
        </div>
        <div class="feature col">
            <div
                class="feature-icon d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center text-bg-primary bg-gradient fs-2 mb-3">
                <svg class="bi" width="1em" height="1em">
                    <use xlink:href="#people-circle"></use>
                </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="fs-2 text-body-emphasis">Restaurants</h3>
            <p>Bahrain is a paradise for food lovers, boasting a rich culinary scene with a mix of traditional Bahraini
                flavors and international cuisines. From fine dining to hidden local gems, every meal in Bahrain is a
                delightful experience.</p>
            <a href="https://www.bahrain-confidential.com/17-highly-recommended-restaurants-to-check-out-in-bahrain/#:~:text=Here%E2%80%99s%20the%20list%20of%20Bahrain%E2%80%99s%20Highly%20Recommended%20Restaurants,premium%204%20Star%20hotels%20and%20other%20hospitality%20experts." class="icon-link">
                Explore More
                <img src="..." alt="">
            </a>
        </div>
        <div class="feature col">
            <div
                class="feature-icon d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center text-bg-primary bg-gradient fs-2 mb-3">
                <img src="..." alt="">
            </div>
            <h3 class="fs-2 text-body-emphasis">Historical Places</h3>
            <p>Steeped in history, Bahrain is home to breathtaking forts, ancient burial mounds, and UNESCO heritage
                sites. Explore its rich past and discover a land where tradition and modernity blend beautifully.</p>
            <a href="https://www.timeoutbahrain.com/culture/historical-landmarks-in-bahrain" class="icon-link">
                Explore More
                <img src="..." alt="">
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
